I Doubled My $10k Trading Account
  Creator shares rules learned from backtesting 2000+ strategies; heavy product promotion.
    idea [data]: min_trade_count — Require >=100 trades in backtest before trusting results
    idea [risk]: max_drawdown_cap — Reject strategies with backtest max drawdown above 20%
    idea [entry]: profit_factor_floor — Require profit factor > 1.1 minimum, prefer >1.5
    idea [exit]: beat_buy_hold — Strategy must beat buy-and-hold benchmark on the same asset/period
    idea [entry]: trend_following_bias — Trend-following strategies are easier to trade live than mean-reversion
    idea [data]: avoid_multi_timeframe — Avoid multi-timeframe/multi-take-profit strategies; prone to lookahead bias
    idea [fees]: fees_and_slippage — Always backtest with real fees; overestimate slippage
    idea [risk]: diversify_bots — Run multiple uncorrelated strategies/coins/timeframes so one covers another's drawdown
    idea [risk]: auto_kill_switch — Build a watcher that disables a strategy showing signs of decay before losses compound
    RED FLAG: Unverified self-reported '$10k doubled in 12 months' claim
    RED FLAG: Promotes paid community (Skool) and third-party tools (TradingKit/TriggerTrade)
